WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.700
An answer needs context.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.200
Ask what supports it.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.200
Start with the source.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.500
Snapshots and recovery.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.200
Still needs qualification.

6
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.700
Abbey, Aviva, ABI: three profiles.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.100
Local routing includes explicit selection.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.500
Strict checks recompute hashes.

9
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.200
Hash links are not signatures.

10
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.500
An audit of thirteen patterns.

11
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.200
Not semantic detection.

12
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.200
Review what each check covers.

13
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.600
A distributed fabric is our vision.

14
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.600
Hardware support requires its own evidence.

15
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.600
Roadmap. No delivery guarantee.

16
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.100
Bring a scoped project.

17
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.600
Let’s review the evidence.
